{"version":1,"page":{"kind":"annotation-detail","href":"/shijing/annotation/013-cai-fan/quwanli-quanshi","dataHref":"/__data/shijing/annotation/013-cai-fan/quwanli-quanshi/data.json","title":"詩經詮釋 · 采蘩 · 注释总览","description":"風 · 召南 · 采蘩 · 汇集《詩經詮釋》关于《采蘩》的 1 条注释，含 10 条注脚。"},"payload":{"detail":{"route":{"poemId":"013-cai-fan","materialId":"quwanli-quanshi"},"href":"/shijing/annotation/013-cai-fan/quwanli-quanshi","poem":{"id":"013-cai-fan","title":"采蘩","categoryId":"feng","subcategoryId":"shaonan","path":["風","召南","采蘩"],"segments":[{"id":"seg-001","text":"于以采蘩","isActive":true},{"id":"seg-002","text":"于沼于沚","isActive":true},{"id":"seg-003","text":"于以用之","isActive":true},{"id":"seg-004","text":"公侯之事","isActive":true},{"id":"seg-005","text":"于以采蘩","isActive":true},{"id":"seg-006","text":"于澗之中","isActive":true},{"id":"seg-007","text":"于以用之","isActive":true},{"id":"seg-008","text":"公侯之宮","isActive":true},{"id":"seg-009","text":"被之僮僮","isActive":true},{"id":"seg-010","text":"夙夜在公","isActive":true},{"id":"seg-011","text":"被之祁祁","isActive":true},{"id":"seg-012","text":"薄言還歸","isActive":true}]},"material":{"id":"quwanli-quanshi","title":"詩經詮釋","authors":["屈萬里"],"contributorLine":"现代 · 屈萬里","era":"现代","publicationYear":1983,"carrier":"PDF"},"stats":{"annotationCount":1,"glossCount":10},"annotations":[{"id":"0001","order":1,"total":1,"layer":"span","layerLabel":"诗句片段","targetText":"于以采蘩于沼于沚于以用之公侯之事于以采蘩于澗之中于以用之公侯之宮被之僮僮夙夜在公被之祁祁薄言還歸","targetNotes":"屈万里在正文后集中列《注释》①-⑩。","sourceLabel":"第 16-17 页","sourceNotes":"第 16 页《采蘩》正文与《注释》①-⑨；第 17 页顶部续《注释》⑩。页图参考：/tmp/quwanli-caifan2/p55.png 与 /tmp/quwanli-caifan2/p56.png。","notes":null,"glosses":[{"key":"0001-1","attributionLabel":"屈万里","sectionLabel":"注释","text":"此詠諸侯夫人祭祀之詩。","notes":null},{"key":"0001-2","attributionLabel":"屈万里","sectionLabel":"注释","text":"于以，與《陳風·東門之枌》之“越以”同，語詞也。胡承珙說。","notes":null},{"key":"0001-3","attributionLabel":"屈万里","sectionLabel":"注释","text":"蘩，音煩，白蒿也。","notes":null},{"key":"0001-4","attributionLabel":"屈万里","sectionLabel":"注释","text":"沼，池也。","notes":null},{"key":"0001-5","attributionLabel":"屈万里","sectionLabel":"注释","text":"沚，渚也。","notes":null},{"key":"0001-6","attributionLabel":"屈万里","sectionLabel":"注释","text":"事，祭祀之事也。古謂祭祀之事曰“有事”，甲骨文、周易爻辭，皆常用此語。","notes":null},{"key":"0001-7","attributionLabel":"屈万里","sectionLabel":"注释","text":"宮，廟也。","notes":null},{"key":"0001-8","attributionLabel":"屈万里","sectionLabel":"注释","text":"被，首飾也。","notes":null},{"key":"0001-9","attributionLabel":"屈万里","sectionLabel":"注释","text":"僮僮、祁祁，皆形容首飾之盛。《經義述聞》說。","notes":null},{"key":"0001-10","attributionLabel":"屈万里","sectionLabel":"注释","text":"朱傳：“公，公所也。此謂宗廟也。”","notes":null}]}]}}}
